{"step_index":643,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-28T21:44:14Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-28T17:44:14-04:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-28T17:44:14-04:00\nFile Path: `file:///Volumes/Untitled/SSOT_Agentic_Brain_v1.1.0_ENGINEERING_RELEASE/ops/runtime/sovra_crdt_kernel.zig`\nTotal Lines: 104\nTotal Bytes: 3482\nShowing lines 1 to 100\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: // SOVRA-NATIVE ZIG CRDT MEMORY DAG KERNEL v2.0\n2: // Objective: Eliminate DCE, add warmup run, consume work payload, measure wall-clock nanoseconds.\n3: \n4: const std = @import(\"std\");\n5: const print = std.debug.print;\n6: \n7: pub const NodeKind = enum(u8) {\n8:     Episode = 0,\n9:     Semantic = 1,\n10:     Procedure = 2,\n11: };\n12: \n13: pub const CrdtNode = struct {\n14:     id: u128,\n15:     kind: NodeKind,\n16:     confidence_byte: u8,\n17:     version_vector: u64,\n18:     parent_id: u128,\n19:     is_tombstoned: bool,\n20: };\n21: \n22: pub const SovraCrdtGraph = struct {\n23:     nodes: [100000]CrdtNode,\n24:     node_count: usize,\n25: \n26:     pub fn init() SovraCrdtGraph {\n27:         return SovraCrdtGraph{\n28:             .nodes = undefined,\n29:             .node_count = 0,\n30:         };\n31:     }\n32: \n33:     pub fn insert_node(self: *SovraCrdtGraph, id: u128, kind: NodeKind, confidence: u8, parent_id: u128) bool {\n34:         if (self.node_count >= 100000) return false;\n35:         self.nodes[self.node_count] = CrdtNode{\n36:             .id = id,\n37:             .kind = kind,\n38:             .confidence_byte = confidence,\n39:             .version_vector = @as(u64, @intCast(self.node_count + 1)),\n40:             .parent_id = parent_id,\n41:             .is_tombstoned = false,\n42:         };\n43:         self.node_cou